[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12600.469, "timestamp": "03:30:00", "text": "比如，呃，所有这些东西，对吧，其他的呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12603.59, "timestamp": "03:30:03", "text": "人们做他们擅长的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12605.269, "timestamp": "03:30:05", "text": "他们擅长讲故事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12608.63, "timestamp": "03:30:08", "text": "唱歌水平、游戏能力等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12610.309, "timestamp": "03:30:10", "text": "任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12614.07, "timestamp": "03:30:14", "text": "嗯，我可以自己做，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12616.229, "timestamp": "03:30:16", "text": "这并不是说，比如有些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12619.03, "timestamp": "03:30:19", "text": "只关注你的游戏表现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12620.87, "timestamp": "03:30:20", "text": "例如裹尸布之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12624.469, "timestamp": "03:30:24", "text": "他们来这里就是为了开枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12626.87, "timestamp": "03:30:26", "text": "就是那种爆头之类的东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12629.349, "timestamp": "03:30:29", "text": "某些观众的裹尸布"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12631.91, "timestamp": "03:30:31", "text": "他们占喊叫社区的百分比"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12634.63, "timestamp": "03:30:34", "text": "它们在那里是为了做裹尸布之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12636.87, "timestamp": "03:30:36", "text": "对，我也想这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12639.269, "timestamp": "03:30:39", "text": "每个人都在玩，他们都在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12642.229, "timestamp": "03:30:42", "text": "只给他准备的。是的。是的。那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12644.469, "timestamp": "03:30:44", "text": "最终目标是最终达成的目标。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12646.63, "timestamp": "03:30:46", "text": "如果你像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12648.95, "timestamp": "03:30:48", "text": "专注于特定细分领域"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12651.91, "timestamp": "03:30:51", "text": "如果你在游戏中没有获得乐趣，那么……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12654.389, "timestamp": "03:30:54", "text": "最后，那就很难了，现在你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12656.63, "timestamp": "03:30:56", "text": "频道会像这样，例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12658.469, "timestamp": "03:30:58", "text": "我的世界内容创作者转行"}]